Embq7JrnXJR_wO6ZN-e1vpi14Pv9-x2ApslXIEzKsmbIy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJyQSZ9TJZmbz15L_p4W-j4myQmtTtJ9vcHyY6kqnOywA&oe=6A9ACAA4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HeliWings VR: Helicopter Simulator", "keywords": ["Helicopter", "Flight", "Flying", "Pilot", "Aircraft"], "long_description": "**Take the controls and experience helicopter flight in VR!**\n\nHeliWings VR: Helicopter Flight puts you in the pilot's seat as you explore stunning environments from the sky. Fly through snow-covered mountains, lush green forests and sprawling city landscapes in an immersive VR flight adventure.\n\n\ud83d\ude81 **FLY A HELICOPTER IN VR**\nExperience the thrill of helicopter flying from an immersive first-person VR perspective. Take off, maneuver through challenging terrain, explore the world and master your aircraft.\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f **SNOWY MOUNTAINS**\nSoar above towering peaks, frozen landscapes and dramatic mountain valleys. Navigate through challenging terrain and discover new views from the sky.\n\n\ud83c\udf32 **LUSH FOREST MOUNTAINS**\nExplore beautiful green mountains covered in dense forests. Fly through valleys, around cliffs and across expansive natural landscapes.\n\n\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f **CITY FLIGHT**\nTake your helicopter into a completely different environment. Fly around buildings, navigate urban areas and experience the scale of a city from above.\n\nWhether you're looking for a **VR helicopter game, helicopter simulator, flight simulator, flying game or aerial exploration adventure**, HeliWings VR puts you behind the controls.\n\n**Three environments. One helicopter. Endless skies.**\n\nTake off and discover the freedom of VR helicopter flight!\n", "short_description": "Take the controls of a helicopter in VR and explore snowy mountains, lush forests and sprawling cities in an immersive flight adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://